Miscellaneous Security Testing
Application: OWASP Juice Shop
Challenge: Privacy Policy
Aim
To examine the application's privacy policy and confirm access to its published data-handling information.
Objective
To locate and read the privacy policy, completing the associated OWASP Juice Shop challenge.
Steps Taken
1. Opened OWASP Juice Shop in the browser.
2. Logged in using the test account.
3. Opened the user menu.
4. Navigated to the Privacy Policy page.
5. Reviewed the displayed information concerning the collection, use and protection of personal data.
6. Checked whether Juice Shop registered completion of the Privacy Policy challenge.
4. Problems Encountered

Test Result
The expected outcome is successful access to the Privacy Policy page, followed by the application's Privacy Policy challenge completion notification. Conclusion
The objective is achieved when the privacy policy is accessed and the challenge is recorded as completed. This exercise demonstrates security awareness and policy discovery rather than exploitation of a vulnerability.
